Maal Ledger — v4.0.2

Added
- Undo last payment: on any installment with a payment recorded, the
  Edit modal now shows an "↩ Undo last payment" button. It reverses
  the most recent payment only (not full history), recalculates the
  installment's status (paid/partial/pending) and received amount,
  removes the matching entry from the Cashbook, and logs the reversal
  in the Audit Log.

Files changed
- js/db.js  — new dbReversePayment(qistId)
- js/app.js — Undo button + handler in the qist edit modal

